// The model chapter 4 makes executable. It is given to you complete: the work of this
// chapter is not writing the argument, it is attaching it to the world.
//
// Four elements, and every one of them has a job in the execution layer. The two evidence
// leaves are artifacts that either exist or do not. The strategy is the only place a
// judgement is made, and it can only judge what the leaves handed it.

justification shippable {

    conclusion claim   is "The classifier is fit to ship"
    strategy   bar     is "The measured accuracy clears the 80% bar"
    evidence   model   is "The trained model is on disk"
    evidence   metrics is "The measurement report is on disk"

    bar     supports claim
    model   supports bar
    metrics supports bar

}
